---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import InfrastructureSketch from '../components/InfrastructureSketch.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Ghadi" description="Ghadi Saab: DevOps engineering student and SRE apprentice in Montpellier.">
  <header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE SYSTEMS</p><h1>Hi, I’m Ghadi<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>Software engineer. Systems thinker. Builder.</p></header>
  <div class="about-layout">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="about-lead">I study DevOps engineering in Montpellier and work as an SRE apprentice, which mostly means figuring out what production is doing and why.</p>
      <p>Outside of that, I build things to see how they work. With a team I’ve rebuilt the core of <a href="/projects/barenetes/">Kubernetes in Rust</a>. At home I run a small <a href="/projects/homelab/">Kubernetes cluster</a>, managed from Git, and this site lives on it. I also keep a <a href="/projects/ctx-memory/">memory tool</a> for the AI coding agents I work with, and send <a href="/open-source/">fixes upstream</a> to other open-source projects.</p>
      <p>Before my current job I spent most of a year at Genvia, a company that builds hydrogen electrolyzers, writing Rust for their factory floor.</p>
      <p>Away from the screen, I lift. I do bodybuilding, coach others on training and nutrition, and I’m preparing for my first competition. I also organise and run distributions of food and essentials with Kouno Maana, an NGO working with families in the Chouf region of Lebanon. I speak French, English and Arabic.</p>
      <p>This site is where I write things down: what I built, how it broke, and what I learned from it.</p>
      <p>If you’re hiring, I’m looking for a 13 to 17 week internship in summer 2027. The easiest way to reach me is <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={siteConfig.github}>Find me on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="about-margin">
      <InfrastructureSketch />
      <p class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE + SYSTEMS + CURIOSITY</p>
      <aside class="now-list" aria-labelledby="now-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow" id="now-heading">NOW <span class="now-date">/ October 2026</span></p>
        <ul>
          <li>SRE apprentice</li>
          <li>Second year of a DevOps engineering degree at Polytech Montpellier</li>
          <li>Waiting on reviews for my first research paper, written with Inria and LIRMM</li>
          <li>Writing Rust on the side</li>
          <li>Training for a first bodybuilding competition</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
